{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c22c9bd492484f0f2cc425ad55cd06e048cfcec81dfe2e1b337360c567609dc0", "ja": "（全体公演は大成功！　みんなの輝きが\nひとつになった、最高のステージだった）", "zh": "（全体公演圆满成功！大家散发的光芒合而为一，\n真是一场最棒的表演了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1001_p", "source_sha256": "77736338d752cf44f227c5cdf540b2952135daf50527e53874f7ffdd12f22b7d", "ja": "（さすがにみんな、疲れてるだろうな。\n今日は家でゆっくり休んで……）", "zh": "（这下大家应该也都很累了吧。\n今天就在家好好休息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "15a48bbfae0f24f8bfbdbf76320e0d349a22b1e274b6f761b9929b534bc0ba20", "ja": "あいたたたたたっ！？　ちょ、ストップストップ！\nもう無理、無理だからぁ～！！", "zh": "哎好痛痛痛痛！等等，暂停、暂停！\n我已经受不了了，不行了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1003_p", "source_sha256": "28485bfb18a2b9ce38ebfcd1f483843000ef7758d1388871749cb56f93a85169", "ja": "（この声は……このみさん！？\nレッスンルームの方からだ！）", "zh": "（这个声音是……木实！？\n是从练习室里传来的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a1e8f47e0eddaf0c3121f7e69c94c1bc72248f08071a3d8388cf4312fdd4c1e1", "ja": "このみさん、どうしました！？", "zh": "木实，发生什么事了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "8c0bf655cd354e1ff9d31e6b6f511be5f8d10f67add528bbdce5473703dd3aeb", "ja": "わぁっ！？　ご、ごめん、このみちゃん！\nだいじょぶ！？", "zh": "哇啊！？抱、抱歉，小木！\n你不要紧吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "2993061a1fe5638c8859e04c97dfb969c03ea80837d001736139f3e9cea692e8", "ja": "うぅ……き、筋肉が悲鳴を上げているわ……。\nでもこの痛みこそ、アダルティの証明よね……。", "zh": "呜……我、我的肌肉在哀号了……\n不过这股痛楚，正是成熟的证明吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "19dfd5e6a050d8974c63c4a5378899cbeab378358e94706cad697f10f36cad71", "ja": "おや、{$P$}さん～。\nお疲れさまです～。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生～\n你辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a7b637a3a91f2cd7402942b91d2376dc57d2f319d1344438d33d087f267b4266", "ja": "美也？　いったい何が……？", "zh": "美也？究竟是怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "24f67c9e344f3c78dfaf873831c65c4852b5d3e05cc641f3347f48e942114c4d", "ja": "今ね、みんなでストレッチしてたんだけど、\nちょっとやりすぎちゃったみたいで……。", "zh": "我们刚刚在做伸展操，\n不过似乎有点做过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "5c837c2bec21b1932d02171d1343085eb19999d97b497c9293bc0d5fc03387e0", "ja": "だ、大丈夫よ海美ちゃん、これくらい……。少し……\nそう、ほんの少し、年齢を感じてるだけだから……。", "zh": "不、不要紧的，海美，这种程度……不过是稍微……\n没错，真的只有稍微让我感受到，一点年龄差距……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "31c90a62742f3e75caa85e126fce9a80fdaf0760afdc8b18114514b3779eeb14", "ja": "も～、紗代子が「限界まで頑張りましょう！」なんて\n言うからだよ～？　アイタタタ……うう、足痛い……。", "zh": "真是的～都是纱代子说「努力挑战极限吧！」\n才会这样的吧～？哎痛痛痛……呜呜，脚好痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "3644a83081fcbea3568d732bdf5ed64951ab0700db4fc04ae52f73c2b9962340", "ja": "歩さんだって、「どっちが伸ばせるか競争だ！」って\n言ってたじゃないですか……うう。", "zh": "步姊自己不是也说了\n「来比赛看谁伸展得最远！」吗……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1013_p", "source_sha256": "38087d12569bb3f1849be1afd42afb814a9db8af32d44bc7c3955f740426d433", "ja": "なんだか、死屍累々って感じだな……。それにしても\n昨日の今日なのに、レッスンなんて大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "这里感觉都尸横遍野了……话说回来，\n昨天公演才刚结束，今天就开始训练没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "c2830948ca9f7696f440435d1ef788cccf5d35cf3a5ff78fb2ed1f160eadc473", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ～。これも、計画通りですから～。\n私たち、最高の状態で本番を迎えられましたし……。", "zh": "不要紧的～因为这也是计划的一环～\n我们顺利在巅峰状态下迎来正式公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "704b63e3b201c64ff1160be889ddf6057bb7e499e18b0cd196c9906af48cfd15", "ja": "そして今、計画通り、限界が……\nあいたたた、あ、足が……うぅ、我慢我慢……！", "zh": "而现在，就跟之前计划的一样，已经要到极限……\n哎痛痛痛，我、我的脚……呜，忍耐忍耐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0821db7e8c2336fee7e3ef33044aab2949d98c77239bea0b8ea3fd16b456c281", "ja": "いや、そこまで我慢しなくても……というか、そんなに\n限界まで頑張る計画じゃなくてもよかったんじゃ……。", "zh": "呃，你不必忍耐成这样……话说回来，\n不需要安排这种努力挑战极限的计划吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3b6abd9288704a96ea93f3545ccdd9e76a3ac544f8265c84450ef67a9b48efdc", "ja": "何言ってるんだよ、{$P$}！\nそんな甘いことじゃ、トップアイドルになれないって！", "zh": "开什么玩笑，{$P$}！\n抱着那种天真的想法是无法成为顶尖偶像的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "e39c646df4cddfcb71a9f95f4e0c993e7815ffe80f8c4aaec2bf9256e8e51270", "ja": "そうそう！　オフだからって、\nのんびり休んでなんかいられないよ～っ！", "zh": "没错没错！就算是假日，\n也没有时间慢慢休息啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "45127b0ca13c21a95f9086da6ab57f21f5c5805fa4b9153d4b618b9a7567435b", "ja": "{$P$}。私たち、今回の公演で\nお客さんに成長した姿を見てもらえたと思わない？", "zh": "{$P$}。你觉得这次的公演，\n是不是成功让观众看到我们成长的模样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c4548073ec0909af7fbce6a6ee0123a26310c90a5d0f4b2f57dfb032cd1bb420", "ja": "？　ええ、そうですね。ファンの人達も、\n765プロの成長を感じてくれたと思います。", "zh": "嗯？喔，对啊。\n我想粉丝们应该也有感受到765艺能的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "676a9d9bd98cfe074c58abded19cd56c8cadebff3c477a283beb56cab3446639", "ja": "でも……だったら次は、もっと成長した\n私たちを見てもらわないといけませんよね！", "zh": "不过……既然如此，下一次我们就必须展现出\n更多的成长才行吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "23b301eeefb9474aee71e29b5ac0ab805704bbf314ba0d27f1ece628910c165d", "ja": "そういうわけなので、今日からまた、\nみんなで頑張ることになったんです～。", "zh": "就是这个道理，所以今天开始，\n我们又要一起努力了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1c6ce762f64c8070c378ae8d88cb72dcd524c606578a3882548e991707b06b78", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことだったのか。\n理由はわかったけど、今は……。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事啊。\n我了解原因了，不过现在还是先……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_1024", "source_sha256": "c6dfee29d570e3b72e33761ecbd9344ae1ae52212de3e08da0ca900771d3fb62", "ja": "休憩だ！", "zh": "休息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2000_p", "source_sha256": "245cc94110fb1736113af4cf6f155e8d9f1888e117c7356644a16b11296189fe", "ja": "いいから、休憩だ。\n追い込むだけがレッスンじゃないぞ！", "zh": "听我的，大家休息吧。\n不是勉强自己就叫做训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2001_p", "source_sha256": "8dfa687082c5e639b1055f44c07cc26438055849bfe1f32388cecab5228a5621", "ja": "それに、きちんと休みをとらないとダメだって\n紗代子だって言ってたじゃないか。", "zh": "况且纱代子之前不是也说过吗？\n必须适时休息才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2002_027say", "source_sha256": "f2fd079f06cd12ed686f1d82bccc73ead822e9ce885d15174218f27aab1ff685", "ja": "あっ！　た、確かにそうでした……。\n私、つい熱くなってしまって……。", "zh": "啊！的、的确是这样……\n我忍不住激动起来就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2003_029umi", "source_sha256": "486f605671a4151e524d49ef6f3d7f7f2dbc24d9c6aa6f0a13cb13bbe0442670", "ja": "うーっ！　でもでも、このままじっとしてるなんて\n私には無理だよ～っ！", "zh": "呜──！可是可是，\n我没办法就这样乖乖不动啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e50eca9f77962c3de2a0207126be11e50e4cd625be0e28a361942c7d063b118d", "ja": "アタシも、ウズウズしちゃって……。", "zh": "我也坐不太住……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2005_042miy", "source_sha256": "d8d08f2c8c1fdeac70cd0c053fae15ca60d6bb0b3a8565270e87858a0549541b", "ja": "それなら、みんなでお散歩して帰りませんか～？\nお散歩なら、そんなに疲れないと思いますよ～。", "zh": "既然如此，大家要不要一起散步回家呢～？\n只是散步的话，应该也不会让身体太累～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a8420cec31a904673546134721fe4efc053b448198da07cfdb59c1760fed6e33", "ja": "おっ、それいいね！　美也、ナイスアイディア♪\n今日は自主練の代わりに、それでいこう！", "zh": "哦，好耶！美也，Nice Idea♪\n今天就用散步来取代自主练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2007_029umi", "source_sha256": "57bd80431b91c43d0112fc8bbe03d4857b29fc208317c80139ada7e18b3640cf", "ja": "はいはーいっ！　だったら私、\n横断歩道の白い部分しか歩かないようにする！", "zh": "好耶好耶──！\n那走路时我要挑斑马线白色的部分踩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2008_027say", "source_sha256": "941bee81dd2fb96d1df9c8a5cb563e5bc2b7c2e383e441c88dbcb2e54000a5a2", "ja": "なるほど……縛りを設けるのはいいかもしれないね。\nそれじゃみんな、行こうか！", "zh": "原来如此……设下条件或许也不错呢。\n那么各位，出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2009_039kon", "source_sha256": "2c44a73a92e159fb361f332908775e8fdc443c882fbdefa53a999e7121f53fe2", "ja": "ウフフ、そうしましょうか。\n{$P$}、お疲れさま♪　また明日ね！", "zh": "呵呵，就这样决定吧。\n{$P$}，辛苦你了♪明天见喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_030_2010_p", "source_sha256": "bdd7d6b0f2a7c19ee84e4a65be0f98979d7c6b4222d8fc9749a47d15444d1e77", "ja": "ああ、お疲れ……\n念を押しておくけど、みんなちゃんと休むんだぞ！", "zh": "好，辛苦了……\n预防万一再提醒一次，大家要好好休息喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
